<title>USA: World sunflowerseed production - USDA.</title>
<headline>World sunflowerseed production - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Agriculture Department world sunflowerseed crop estimates by countries and regions (million tonnes) --</p>
<p>    -		  1996/97		    1995/96</p>
<p>		   Nov 96    Oct 96	 Nov 96    Oct 96</p>
<p> World Total    23.83     23.72	  25.78     25.78</p>
<p>	  U.S.     1.53	1.53	   1.82	1.82</p>
<p>     Ex-USSR     5.31	5.71	   7.38	7.38</p>
<p>   Argentina     5.00	4.50	   5.60	5.60</p>
<p>	    EU     3.82	3.82	   3.23	3.23</p>
<p>    East Eur     3.16	3.16	   2.72	2.72</p>
<p>	 China     1.36	1.36	   1.27	1.27</p>
<p>	 India     1.50	1.50	   1.40	1.40</p>
<p>	Turkey     0.66	0.66	   0.75	0.75</p>
<p>    S.Africa     0.53	0.53	   0.72	0.72</p>
